border-right-width: 1px; border-right-style: solid;\" width=\"93\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: large; line-height: 21px;\">2013-9-30</span></td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"border-color: rgb(212, 208, 200) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(212, 208, 200); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; background-color: transparent; height: 109px; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-style: solid;\" width=\"234\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 21px; background-color: transparent;\">　　</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font color=\"#26214a\" face=\"Simsun\"><span style=\"line-height: 28px;\">敏锐把握世界科技创新发展趋势，切实把创新驱动发展战略实施好</span></font></span><a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1002/c64094-23096105.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: 宋体; font-size: large; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><u>（</u><font color=\"#0000ff\">全文</font></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: 宋体; font-size: large; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">）</font></span></a></p>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"border-color: rgb(212, 208, 200) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(212, 208, 200); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; background-color: transparent; height: 109px; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-style: solid;\" valign=\"center\" width=\"217\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 21px;\">　　</span><span style=\"line-height: 28px; font-family: Simsun; color: rgb(38, 33, 74); font-size: 16px;\">采取调研、讲解、讨论相结合的形式</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"middle\" style=\"border-color: rgb(212, 208, 200) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(255, 153, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; background-color: transparent; height: 109px; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-style: solid;\" width=\"101\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 21px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\">　第八次</span></p>\n</td>\n<td align=\"middle\" style=\"border-color: rgb(212, 208, 200) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(212, 208, 200); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; background-color: transparent; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-style: solid;\" width=\"93\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">　</span>\n<p style=\"line-height: 21px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: large;\"> 2013-7-30</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 21px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">　</span></p>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"border-color: rgb(212, 208, 200) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(255, 153, 0) rgb(212, 208, 200); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; background-color: transparent; height: 109px; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-style: solid;\" width=\"234\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 21px;\">　　</span><font color=\"#26214a\" face=\"Simsun\"><span style=\"line-height: 28px;\">进一步关心海洋、认识海洋</span></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font color=\"#26214a\" face=\"Simsun\"><span style=\"line-height: 28px;\">、经略海洋，推动我国海洋强国建设不断取得新成就</span></font></span><a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/0731/c64094-22399483.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font face=\"宋体\" size=\"4\" style=\"line-height: 21px; background-color: transparent;\"><font class=\"fbody\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><u>（</u><font color=\"#0000ff\">全文</font></span><